From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:30:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Collect the relocated fork tests and restore the dropped cases

The vitest move left fork tests under apps/web/src with a -test suffix,
which no runner collects, and four merges kept none of the branch's
tests: slash-command double enter, bot-command autocomplete, compact
message actions, video filename titles, and escaped entities in a
formatted body. Threads open full-size on this build, login items no
longer pass the removed openAsHidden flag, and the preferences snapshot
matches the settings that render.

Emoji-only HTML goes through sanitizeHtmlText, which is where
getHtmlText moved. Collected suites that still called jest now call vi.

This replaces 0001, 0002, 0005 and 0006. 0003 edited a jest config
upstream has deleted. 0004 still applies and stays.

---
